    "Description": "Libyang is YANG data modeling language parser and toolkit written (and providing API) in C.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* libyang: libyang: Denial of Service or arbitrary code execution via maliciously crafted LYB binary blob (CVE-2026-44673)\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* Rebase libyang to version 2.1.148 to support FRR in FDP (JIRA:RHEL-224590)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
